			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**Le nombre entre parenthèses.** ${{k}} \\times ({{a}} + N) = {{r}}$, donc $({{a}} + N) = {{r}} \\div {{k}} = {{eval:a+n}}$.",
					"**Le nombre choisi.** ${{a}} + N = {{eval:a+n}}$, donc $N = {{eval:a+n}} - {{a}} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{n}}}$.",
					"**Vérification.** ${{k}} \\times ({{a}} + {{n}}) = {{k}} \\times {{eval:a+n}} = {{r}}$."
				]
			}
